                  <paragraph>Preserve in well-closed containers</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Store at 20° to 25°C (68° to 77°F); excursions permitted to 15° to 30°C (59° to 86°F) [see USP Controlled Room Temperature].</paragraph>
